  "prefLabel": "Liq 703.06 License Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 703.06 License Fees. The initial or renewal fee for any license shall be the sum of the license- months divided by 12 multiplied by the annual cost for each category pursuant to RSA 178:29 except for seasonal, special, supplemental, beer festival, and state fair licenses.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
